$DATUM 7446-70-0
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM ε -Caprolactam. A mixture of cyclohexanone oxime (1.4 g, 12.4 mmol) and
anhydrous aluminium chloride (2.4 g, 26 mmol) was throughly ground in an
agate motor for a few minutes. After the evolution of HCl, the reaction
mixture was ground by heating (50-80°C ) for 30 min. The reaction mixture
was mixed with crushed ice and the product was extracted by a continue
extraction apparatus. Distillation of the residue at reduce pressure
afforded ε -caprolactam. Isolated yield :1.35 gr(97%). ε -Caprolactam,
yield 1.35 gr (97%) m.p. 68-69°.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A facile Beckmann rearrangement of oximes with AlCl3 in the solid state
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Ghiaci, M.; Imanzadeh, G. Hassan
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthetic Communications (1998), 28(12), 2275-2280

